    <p class="ds-subsection-title">Full CSS block (copy into game &lt;style&gt;)</p>
    <pre class="ds-code">
.playing-card {
  width: 56px; height: 82px;
  background: white;
  border: 1.5px solid #d1d5db;
  border-radius: 6px;
  box-sizing: border-box;
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  justify-content: space-between;
  padding: 3px 4px;
  font-weight: bold;
  font-family: monospace;
  color: #1e293b;
  cursor: pointer;
  user-select: none;
  flex-shrink: 0;
  position: relative;
}
.playing-card.red  { color: #dc2626; }
.playing-card.face-down {
  background: repeating-linear-gradient(
    135deg,
    #1e40af 0px, #1e40af 4px,
    #1d4ed8 4px, #1d4ed8 8px
  );
  border-color: #1e3a8a;
  cursor: default;
}
.playing-card.selected         { border-color:#3b82f6; box-shadow:0 0 0 2px #3b82f6, 0 0 10px rgba(59,130,246,0.5); }
.playing-card.hinted           { border-color:#fbbf24; animation:pc-hint-pulse 0.9s ease-in-out infinite; }
.playing-card.foundation-ready { border-color:#22c55e; animation:pc-foundation-pulse 0.9s ease-in-out infinite; }
@keyframes pc-hint-pulse {
  0%,100% { box-shadow:0 0 0 2px #fbbf24, 0 0 8px rgba(251,191,36,0.4); }
  50%     { box-shadow:0 0 0 3px #fbbf24, 0 0 16px rgba(251,191,36,0.7); }
}
@keyframes pc-foundation-pulse {
  0%,100% { box-shadow:0 0 0 2px #22c55e, 0 0 8px rgba(34,197,94,0.4); }
  50%     { box-shadow:0 0 0 3px #22c55e, 0 0 16px rgba(34,197,94,0.7); }
}
.pc-corner         { display:flex; flex-direction:column; align-items:flex-start; line-height:1; gap:1px; }
.pc-corner.pc-bottom { transform:rotate(180deg); align-self:flex-end; }
.pc-rank           { font-size:0.75rem; }
.pc-suit           { font-size:0.6rem; }
.pc-center         { position:absolute; inset:0; display:flex; align-items:center;
                     justify-content:center; font-size:1.1rem; pointer-events:none; }</pre
    >
    <p class="ds-note">
      Width / height are the base 56×82 px defaults (aspect ratio ≈ 1:1.46). Override them per-game when responsive
      sizing is needed — e.g. Solitaire computes <code>cardW</code> from viewport width and sets inline
      <code>style="width:…;height:…"</code> on each card element.
    </p>
  </section>

